        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "ed7de539-9963-4832-a025-99a6ff240d98",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Address board: The\nclinic takes\nblankets, never\nbells. The roof",
                "watch takes bells,\nnever food. Cocoa\nCorner takes the\nsoup tin. Red",
                "shelf holds bells.\nBlue shelf holds\nblankets. The soup\nis already at",
                "the dispatch desk."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1b191e85-33dd-4d61-a2ee-c3d0e63c254b",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "65c3eee9-cda9-459c-ab35-9b464e3d6f96",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "A second shipment\nhas a tin of soup\nand a packet of\npaper medicine",
                "labels. The clinic\ntakes the labels\nand requires a dry\ncontainer.",
                "Cocoa takes soup\nand can accept a\nwashable crate.\nThe only dry box",
                "holds the soup;\nthe washable crate\nholds the labels.\nBoth containers",
                "have correct\naddress tags for\ntheir contents.\nMoxie says the\ntags",
                "are right but the\npacking still\nneeds a decision."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "68849d10-c6c6-4642-a9db-021dc9224baf",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "79b73fbf-2dda-4e3f-af50-86f08ebd4517",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The blue parcel\nhas a stitched\nsquare and smells\nfaintly of cedar.",
                "Inside the tag, a\nnurse has written:\nThank you for\nsending things",
                "that fit actual\npeople. Moxie\nchecks the seal,\nthen marks this as\na",
                "protected\ndelivery."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e99ce275-9ea6-468a-a668-3dc3dad96c05",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "43c39625-d47b-4439-acd5-35eec60abcf2",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Choose the\ndestination for\nthe red shelf\nparcel. Use the\ncontents",
                "and recipient\nrules on the\naddress board,\nrather than the\ncolor",
                "alone."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad43e97b-74fc-4db3-aecf-4b9d1c58b6ac",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "7002743b-9df8-4a15-ac51-bf3c357e1991",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which action meets\nboth handling\nneeds without\nchanging who\nreceives",
                "either item? The\naddress tags can\nmove with their\ncontents. Nothing",
                "is spoiled yet,\nand there is no\nhurry. A correct\ndelivery means",
                "checking the\nparcel as well as\nthe name on it.\nMoxie waits with\nthe",
                "dispatch pen\ninstead of\nrewarding the\nfirst answer."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2cdadd6a-d45d-4643-ac10-d66a99cbcebc",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "62c114ef-5cbb-47c6-abc4-90d82efe8719",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Moxie: The point\nis that each\nparcel has a\nreason to be on\nthe cart.",
                "We are not making\nthe city look\nsupplied. We are\nsupplying it. She",
                "keeps the spare\nlabel in case\nsomeone tries to\nsend the clinic a",
                "decorative gong."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
